  {"id": "vo.konnichiwa", "lesson": "le.l01", "lesson_order": 22, "surface": "こんにちは", "kana": "こんにち は", "zh": ["你好（白天的問候）"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l01.035", "se.l02.072"], "trap_zh": "最後的 {ja:は} 讀 wa，和助詞一樣。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.ohayou_gozaimasu", "lesson": "le.l01", "lesson_order": 23, "surface": "おはようございます", "kana": "おはよう ございます", "zh": ["早安"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l01.036", "se.l01.037"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.konbanwa", "lesson": "le.l01", "lesson_order": 24, "surface": "こんばんは", "kana": "こんばん は", "zh": ["晚安（晚上見面的問候）"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l01.038", "se.l01.039"], "trap_zh": "這是晚上見面時的問候；睡前或道別時說的「晚安」是 {ja:おやすみなさい}。最後的 {ja:は} 讀 wa。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.sayounara", "lesson": "le.l01", "lesson_order": 25, "surface": "さようなら", "kana": "さようなら", "zh": ["再見"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l01.040", "se.l01.041"], "trap_zh": "帶有較長時間分別的語感，朋友之間每天道別時很少用。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.arigatou_gozaimasu", "lesson": "le.l01", "lesson_order": 26, "surface": "ありがとうございます", "kana": "ありがとう ございます", "zh": ["謝謝"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l01.042", "se.l01.043"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.sumimasen", "lesson": "le.l01", "lesson_order": 27, "surface": "すみません", "kana": "すみません", "zh": ["對不起", "不好意思"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l01.044", "se.l01.045"], "trap_zh": "除了道歉，叫店員、借過、向人道謝時都能用。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.ii_desu_ne", "lesson": "le.l07", "lesson_order": 2, "surface": "いいですね", "kana": "いい です ね", "zh": ["好啊", "不錯耶"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l07.009", "se.l07.048"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.douzo", "lesson": "le.l15", "lesson_order": 26, "surface": "どうぞ", "kana": "どうぞ", "zh": ["請", "請用"], "pos": "adv", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l15.040", "se.l15.041", "se.l15.048"], "trap_zh": "遞東西或請人先做時說。「請幫我做」要用 {ja:〜てください}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.douitashimashite", "lesson": "le.l15", "lesson_order": 27, "surface": "どういたしまして", "kana": "どういたしまして", "zh": ["不客氣"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l15.018", "se.l15.019"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.arigatou_gozaimashita", "lesson": "le.l15", "lesson_order": 28, "surface": "ありがとうございました", "kana": "ありがとう ございました", "zh": ["謝謝（事情結束後）"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l15.020", "se.l15.021"], "trap_zh": "對方已經幫完忙時用過去形；正在接受幫助時用 {ja:ありがとうございます}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.moshimoshi", "lesson": "le.l16", "lesson_order": 1, "surface": "もしもし", "kana": "もしもし", "zh": ["喂（電話）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet", "device"], "examples": ["se.l16.001", "se.l16.002", "se.l17.016"], "trap_zh": "現在幾乎只在電話裡用；當面叫住人通常說 {ja:すみません}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.un", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 1, "surface": "うん", "kana": "うん", "zh": ["嗯（肯定）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["greet"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.001", "se.l22.060", "se.l30.055"], "trap_zh": "朋友間的「是」。對長輩或客人要說 {ja:はい}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.uun", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 2, "surface": "ううん", "kana": "ううん", "zh": ["不（否定）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.002", "se.l21.054", "se.l22.059", "se.l24.066"], "trap_zh": "朋友間的「不是」，要讀長一點，和 {ja:うん} 分清楚。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.aa", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 3, "surface": "ああ", "kana": "ああ", "zh": ["啊（應答）", "嗯"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l21.003", "se.l21.004"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.ett", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 4, "surface": "えっ", "kana": "えっ", "zh": ["咦（驚訝）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l21.005", "se.l21.006", "se.l23.005"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.hee", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 5, "surface": "へえ", "kana": "へえ", "zh": ["喔（聽到新鮮事）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l21.007", "se.l21.008"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.nee", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 6, "surface": "ねえ", "kana": "ねえ", "zh": ["欸（叫人）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.010", "se.l21.009", "se.l22.061", "se.l24.067"], "trap_zh": "放句首叫朋友；句尾的 {ja:ね} 是語氣助詞。接電話時的「喂」要說 {ja:もしもし}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.gomen", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 7, "surface": "ごめん", "kana": "ごめん", "zh": ["對不起（朋友間）"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.012", "se.l21.013", "se.l22.062", "se.l23.008"], "trap_zh": "朋友、家人之間用。對長輩說 {ja:すみません}；對客人或正式場合說 {ja:申し訳ありません|もうしわけありません}。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.arigatou", "lesson": "le.l21", "lesson_order": 31, "surface": "ありがとう", "kana": "ありがとう", "zh": ["謝謝（較隨意）"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "use_level": "friends_only", "examples": ["se.l21.064", "se.l21.065", "se.c_lost_item.03"], "trap_zh": "較隨意的道謝，常用於熟人之間。對長輩、客人、上司或正式場合，優先說完整的 {ja:ありがとうございます} 較禮貌。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.odaiji_ni", "lesson": "le.l25", "lesson_order": 24, "surface": "お大事に", "kana": "おだいじに", "zh": ["請保重"], "pos": "phrase", "accent": null, "jlpt": "beyond", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l25.050", "se.l25.051"], "trap_zh": "對生病、受傷的人，或家人生病、受傷的人說的固定用語（請對方保重、祝早日康復）；沒有人生病或受傷時不用。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.oiwai", "lesson": "le.l28", "lesson_order": 8, "surface": "お祝い", "kana": "おいわい", "zh": ["祝賀", "賀禮"], "pos": "n", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l28.044", "se.l28.022", "se.l29.057"], "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.orei", "lesson": "le.l28", "lesson_order": 9, "surface": "お礼", "kana": "おれい", "zh": ["道謝", "謝禮"], "pos": "n", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n4", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l28.045", "se.l28.046"], "trap_zh": "{ja:お礼を言う|おれいをいう} 是道謝。", "notes": ["no.sj.rei"]},
  {"id": "vo.ee", "lesson": "le.l29", "lesson_order": 27, "surface": "ええ", "kana": "ええ", "zh": ["是的", "嗯"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l29.025", "se.l29.059"], "trap_zh": "比 {ja:はい} 柔和；對長輩正式場合仍以 {ja:はい} 為主。", "notes": []},
  {"id": "vo.doumo", "lesson": "le.l29", "lesson_order": 28, "surface": "どうも", "kana": "どうも", "zh": ["謝謝", "不好意思", "實在"], "pos": "interj", "accent": null, "jlpt": "n5", "topics": ["greet"], "examples": ["se.l29.060", "se.l29.061"], "trap_zh": "{ja:どうも} 單獨說是較隨意的謝謝；正式要說完整的 {ja:ありがとうございます}。", "notes": []}
